\subtree{
\title{3. Whole processes (CPU of all threads, wall clock, peak RSS, instructions)}

\p{One process per variant, measured with \src{bench/measure.sh}. "per pass" = (process - set-up-only process) / passes. CPU and wall clock of single processes carry the host's 10-20\% noise; use section 2 for CPU ratios. In JVM mode the process CPU includes the JIT compiler threads.}

