\subtree{
\title{6. Verification}

\p{\src{spikes/stepper/scripts/verify.sh}: R and every variant on every root in one arena (identical normal form id, value id and verdict required), then the TRY experiment: CONV of every Init root under a budget of ticks, with D = 0 (every frame materialised, W cut to the TRY frame), D = 64 and D = infinity (host unwinding only).}

\pre{\verb~|
